  "FLASH->ACR ; 0x40022000 | 32 | 18 DBG_SWEN, 16 PROGEMPTY, 11 ICRST, 9 ICEN, 8 PRFTEN, !2:0 LATENCY\n# RCC->CR bits left unnamed: 19:16 external-oscillator (HSE) and CSS, 9 and 7:5 the kernel clock\nRCC->CR ; 0x40021000 | 32 | 19, 18, 17, 16, !13:11 HSIDIV, !10 HSIRDY, 9, 8 HSION, 7:5": "/registers/cbe1cfc02644c7eabde9ac61.svg",
